<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>{title}</title>
    {@include "Head"}
    <script src="/assets/{assets?.['partnership-estimate.js']}" defer></script>
  </head>
  <body class="post-page partnership-page">
    <SkipLink />
    {@include "TimeOfDayBackground"}
    <main id="main-content" class="partnership-content">
      <a class="back-link" href="/">← Home</a>
      <header class="partnership-hero">
        <h1>Let's work together.</h1>
        <p>I design and build websites and digital systems for people with something to share.</p>
      </header>
      <section class="partnership-section partnership-estimator-section" id="estimate">
        <h2>Project estimate</h2>
        <form class="partnership-estimate">
          <div class="partnership-estimate-inputs">
            <label><span>Service</span><select name="service"><option value="design">Design</option><option value="development">Development</option><option value="both">Design and development</option></select></label>
            <label><span>Scope</span><select name="scope"><option value="0">Core</option><option value="1">Presence</option><option value="2">System</option></select></label>
          </div>
          <div class="partnership-estimate-result"><span>Starting at</span><output aria-live="polite">€200</output></div>
        </form>
        <a class="partnership-contact-link" href="mailto:me@gxbs.dev?subject=Working%20together">Discuss your project →</a>
        <details class="partnership-price-details"><summary>See all prices</summary>
        <div class="partnership-table-wrap"><table>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Service</th><th scope="col">Core</th><th scope="col">Presence</th><th scope="col">System</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><th scope="row">Design</th><td>€200</td><td>€450</td><td>€950</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Development</th><td>€300</td><td>€700</td><td>€1,500</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Design and development</th><td>€420</td><td>€1,050</td><td>€2,200</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table></div>
        <p>Launch support: €80 · Care plan: €200</p>
        </details>
      </section>
      <section class="partnership-section partnership-process">
        <h2>Working together</h2>
        <p>We start by discussing your project and agreeing on its scope. A 50% retainer reserves your spot, with the remainder due at launch. You'll have three structured reviews and access to staging from day one.</p>
        <p>Returning partnerships receive a 10% discount. A full refund is available before execution begins.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="partnership-section partnership-questions">
        <h2>Questions</h2>
        <details><summary>How long does a project take?</summary><p>Most Core projects take 1–2 weeks, Presence projects 2–4 weeks, and System projects 4–8 weeks.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What is included?</summary><p>Strategy alignment, creative reviews, implementation, and a handoff package.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Do I own the work?</summary><p>Once the project is finalized and paid in full, you receive ownership of the repository, source code, and design files.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can we build on what I already have?</summary><p>Yes. Share your current website or tools and I can review what can be reused or improved.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can you work under an NDA?</summary><p>Yes, I'm open to signing non-disclosure agreements.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What if the scope changes?</summary><p>Additional features and revisions are scoped and agreed upon before work continues.</p></details>
      </section>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
